\caption[]{Reconstructed maps of the large-scale field of AU~Mic (left, middle and right columns for the radial, azimuthal and 
meridional components in spherical coordinates, in G), for season 2023A, 2023B, 2024A and 2024b (top to bottom row respectively), derived 
from the Stokes $V$ LSD profiles of Fig.~\ref{fig:fit} using ZDI.  The maps are shown in a flattened polar projection down to latitude
