commutative. The identity encoded by said commuting diagram is precisely the claimed identity $\theta_{T^{m+1}f} \circ (c \ast T^m)_X = \tilde{c}_m \circ T\theta_{T^mf}$. %In particular, this implies that there is a unique isomorphism
