\title{Leveraging Transfer Learning and User-Specific Updates for Rapid Training of BCI Decoders}

\author{Ziheng Chen$^{1,\star}$, Po T. Wang$^{1}$, Mina Ibrahim$^{1}$, Shivali Baveja$^{2}$, Rong Mu$^{3}$, An H. Do$^{4}$, and Zoran Nenadic$^{1,3,\star}$
