\begin{abstract}
This is a survey paper that discusses the original bounds 
of the seminal papers by Chernoff and Hoeffding.
Moreover, it includes a variety of derivative bounds in a
variety of forms. Complete proofs are provided as needed.
The intent is to provide  a repository of reference bounds
for the interested researcher.
\end{abstract}


