\subsection{Gates}\label{sec:Gates}
We begin by introducing the quantum gates employed in our state preparation protocol. 
%To maintain consistency with the standard language of quantum computation, we adopt the convention that $\ket{g}$ corresponds to $\ket{0}$ and $\ket{e}$ to $\ket{1}$.
