Note that since the analytic approximations from \citet{hu2001cosmic} depend only on three parameters, while {\sc PolyCAMB-peak} fits all six cosmological parameters, for ease of comparison we retain only the monomial terms shared with \citet{hu2001cosmic}. The remaining terms, involving additional parameters, are considered subdominant. 
